        },
        {
          "text": " “Ne wikopia chirupia, namwe siakhulia namwe sisiindu sisiindi siosi siosi khu Muisiraeli wasio, okharaakho bukhala tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyala waraakho bukhala khu nibio wikopia baakwa, ne okhakholela orio Omuisiraeli wasio tawe. Khola orio nio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wowo akhuelesie ewe chikhabi mu buli sisiindu nisio okhola mu sibala nisio olikho ocha khumenya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
