              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ne wingila mu liruuti lio wasio lie kimisabibu, onyala walia kamatuunda ke kimisabibu niko wenya. Ne okharaakho liosi liosi mu ndubi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne wingila mu lusaambu lwe biakhulia lwo wasio, onyala walia biakhulia bioosi bioosi nibio onyala wabuta ne kamakhono kowo, ne kakhali okhabikesakho ne ngeso tawe.",
          "type": "text",
